## 8. Risks

`train_batches_per_epoch` 9 265 ≠ 9 261 changes the `seen_aug` yaw counter (§2; recorded, intended). The released reference row's provenance is external (unknown budget/epoch/realisation/selection) and is never compared inferentially. Host contention with exp_05/exp_06 evaluations is the only timing risk; no gate beyond epoch 1 depends on it.

